<li>The Expert Manual&#8217;s long chapter 7 is three chapters now: <b>7 Playlists</b>, <b>8 Sessions</b>, <b>9 Sharing, Packages &amp; Deliveries</b>; Frame Grabs &amp; Reports, Keyboard Shortcuts and Web Review are 10&#8211;12.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
